  "customHelp": "To build a Leader:\n1. Hide a card in your hand: Right-click -> Hide -OR- Z + Click.\n2. Move the hidden card under your Leader: Right-click -> Group -> Click on Leader -OR- G + Click + Click on Leader.\n3. Flip the Leader: Right-click -> Flip -OR- Ctrl+Z + Click.\n\nTo unbuild a Leader:\n1. Move the card under your Leader to your trash: Drag\n2. Flip the Leader: Right-click -> Flip -OR- Ctrl+Z + Click.\n\nTo play a Medapart: Right-click -> Group -> Click on Equipped Medabot -OR- G + Click + Click on Equipped Medabot.\nWhen playing from the Medawatch, first Drag or Click -> Search -> Play.\n\nFor more information and individual card rulings go to: https://fbanda.github.io/MedalClashWeb/",
